  <item>
    <title>卖书的最大苦恼是喜欢的书卖不爆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6487f8e06752b5f9de9bb019</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6487f8e06752b5f9de9bb019</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Jun 2023 05:04:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>标题党了我承认，是大部分。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有小部分喜欢的书也会卖爆的，那这就是卖书人最高兴的时候。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天也是一期杂七杂八的闲扯淡，尤其是一开始，有点没找准状态，10分钟以后才渐入佳境。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 小红书发力直播电商，对卖书（我俩这种冷门书主播）有什么影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">08:39</a> 最近的很大苦恼：总是拒绝大爆书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 聊到了人类文明的走向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1515">25:15</a> 写书、做书的孤独</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 又锵锵起来了……关于欲望的争论</span></p><span></span><p><span>后面几乎都是对直播的复盘，就拆了……懒了烦了就干到这儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>大概是40来分钟的时候又吵起来了（不是），聊了聊对待工作的态度，看书的喜好等等吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>————</span></p><span></span><p><span>涉及书单</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈嘉映教授的作品 《在小山和小山之间》上海文艺出版社 刘以鬯 夏坚勇 宋史三部曲</span></p><span></span><p><span>《烟霞里》魏微著 人民文学出版社</span></p><span></span><p><span>莎士比亚戏剧 《飘》</span></p><span></span><p><span>茅海建《苦命天子》《天朝的崩溃》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《李淼罪案故事》《尸语女法医》《长安的荔枝》</span></p><span></span><p><span>常书鸿 敦煌四书</span></p><span></span><p><span>《游隼》《抓住十二只喜鹊的尾巴》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《现代性与大屠杀》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《历史的温度》</span></p><span></span><p><span>————</span></p><span></span><p><span>上周直播间里卖的书</span></p><span></span><p><span>故宫三书 广西师范大学出版社</span></p><span></span><p><span>《寻梦与归来：敦煌宝藏离合史》 广西师范大学出版社</span></p><span></span><p><span>《少年读三国》刘勃 果麦文化</span></p><span></span><p><span>《角斗场的图兰朵》田浩江 三联书店×活字文化</span></p><span></span><p><span>《空芯手帐》新经典文化</span></p><span></span><p><span>《中国古代异闻录》呼延云 浙江人民出版社</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loYHJXSzWlPBMTFeQ-RqiUUIWUU-.m4a" length="74551847" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1bEdMOFFhalZKWjQ2NDdoUVpIbDc5LXl0TWsucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>618大促要来了，书该怎么卖？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/647d7fb95ed4bd1a461a20c4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">647d7fb95ed4bd1a461a20c4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Jun 2023 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 以前618大促，实体书店干啥呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">06:33</a> 如今的618大促对实体书店意味着什么&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="934">15:34</a> 618大促在书业的一点变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1964">32:44</a> &nbsp;上周直播间销冠“宋史三部曲”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2622">43:42</a> 我们是怎么选书的+夫妻日常吵架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2890">48:10</a> 《长安的荔枝》为什么没带，为什么我们离爆款书远</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3156">52:36</a> 上周直播销亚 马伯庸的新书《太白金星有点烦》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3502">58:22</a> &nbsp;上周直播销季《我不相信神话》《桑塔格传》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3747">62:27</a> 直播讲书的一点小心得+夫妻日常吵架again</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4266">71:06</a> 上周直播带得不尽如意的一本书《坚：三国前传之孙坚匡汉》&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>涉及书单</span></p><span></span><p><span>《三案始末》三联书店</span></p><span></span><p><span>《尤利西斯》特装版 译林出版社</span></p><span></span><p><span>宋史三部曲 译林出版社</span></p><span></span><p><span>《千面宋人》《大宋之法》“知宋”系列 广西师范大学出版社</span></p><span></span><p><span>《月照青苔》《枪炮与货币》《民初气象》赵柏田著</span></p><span></span><p><span>新版村上春树 上海译文出版社</span></p><span></span><p><span>《长安的荔枝》《太白金星有点烦》博集天卷</span></p><span></span><p><span>《多谈谈问题》上海文艺出版社</span></p><span></span><p><span>《带壳的牡蛎是大人的心脏》时代华语</span></p><span></span><p><span>《蛤蟆先生去看心理医生》果麦文化</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我不相信神话》新经典</span></p><span></span><p><span>《桑塔格传》译林出版社</span></p><span></span><p><span>《坚：三国前传之孙坚匡汉》铸刻文化&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红薯id：小迪迪迪迪迪迪</span></p><span></span><p><span>买书和看直播到这里去找我们哦！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/li1vJ5aWZORr9GPBDPZqdCaRxbeh.m4a" length="80253049" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:22:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqWkI1NWswT0FWNGg5ZHZZX0o4NFpRYWwtVmQucG5n.png"/>
